ae2s_ponder.gui.export_bus.step.0=Select items to send from ME storage into the adjacent inventory. An empty filter does not specify a desired item.
ae2s_ponder.gui.export_bus.target.widget.verticalToolbar=Operation settings
ae2s_ponder.gui.export_bus.step.1=Read the supported redstone, matching, scheduling and access settings. Availability depends on this bus and installed cards.
ae2s_ponder.gui.export_bus.target.widget.upgrades=Upgrade cards
ae2s_ponder.gui.export_bus.step.2=Install only compatible cards. Extra filter slots can remain disabled until the required capacity upgrade is present.
ae2s_ponder.gui.export_bus.step.3=Use a small amount to confirm direction, free destination space and network power. Avoid a direct import/export loop on the same inventory.
ae2s_ponder.gui.storage_bus.title=Storage Bus
ae2s_ponder.gui.storage_bus.target.slot.CONFIG.0=Resource filter
ae2s_ponder.gui.storage_bus.step.0=Expose an external inventory as ME storage. Items remain in that external inventory until moved by an actual operation.
ae2s_ponder.gui.storage_bus.target.widget.verticalToolbar=Operation settings
ae2s_ponder.gui.storage_bus.step.1=Read the supported redstone, matching, scheduling and access settings. Availability depends on this bus and installed cards.
ae2s_ponder.gui.storage_bus.target.widget.upgrades=Upgrade cards
ae2s_ponder.gui.storage_bus.step.2=Install only compatible cards. Extra filter slots can remain disabled until the required capacity upgrade is present.
ae2s_ponder.gui.storage_bus.step.3=Use a small amount to confirm direction, free destination space and network power. Avoid a direct import/export loop on the same inventory.
ae2s_ponder.gui.precise_export_bus.title=Precise Export Bus
ae2s_ponder.gui.precise_export_bus.target.slot.CONFIG.0=Resource filter
