ae2s_ponder.gui.pickup_filter.target.widget.verticalToolbar=Matching mode
ae2s_ponder.gui.pickup_filter.step.1=Check the supported matching and inclusion mode. Start with a narrow filter to avoid collecting unwanted resources.
ae2s_ponder.gui.pickup_filter.target.widget.back=Test pickup
ae2s_ponder.gui.pickup_filter.step.2=Return to the cell and test one dropped item with enough charge and capacity.
ae2s_ponder.gui.void_cell.title=Void Cell: disposal mode
