ae2s_ponder.gui.void_cell.step.1=Restrict which resources can reach this device and test with expendable items before connecting a main storage network.
ae2s_ponder.gui.void_cell.target.widget.matterBalls=Products and capacity
ae2s_ponder.gui.void_cell.step.2=If producing matter outputs, keep space for them and check the actual conversion requirements.
ae2s_ponder.gui.portable_void_cell.title=Portable Void Cell
ae2s_ponder.gui.portable_void_cell.target.widget.mode=Disposal mode
ae2s_ponder.gui.portable_void_cell.step.0=Read the disposal or matter-conversion mode carefully. Resources accepted for disposal cannot be treated as recoverable normal storage.
ae2s_ponder.gui.portable_void_cell.target.view.body=Narrow the input
ae2s_ponder.gui.portable_void_cell.step.1=Restrict which resources can reach this device and test with expendable items before connecting a main storage network.
ae2s_ponder.gui.portable_void_cell.target.slot.MACHINE_OUTPUT.0=Products and capacity
ae2s_ponder.gui.portable_void_cell.step.2=If producing matter outputs, keep space for them and check the actual conversion requirements.
ae2s_ponder.gui.wireless_magnet.title=Wireless magnet settings
ae2s_ponder.gui.wireless_magnet.target.slot.MAGNET_PICKUP_CONFIG.0=Pickup rules
ae2s_ponder.gui.wireless_magnet.step.0=Select which dropped resources may be picked up. Keep the pickup filter narrow while testing.
ae2s_ponder.gui.wireless_magnet.target.slot.MAGNET_INSERT_CONFIG.0=Insertion rules
