ae2s_ponder.gui.priority.target.text.priority_extraction_hint=Extraction order
ae2s_ponder.gui.priority.step.2=Check the extraction rule separately, then test one resource before reorganizing the whole network.
ae2s_ponder.gui.priority_tuner.title=Priority Tuner
ae2s_ponder.gui.priority_tuner.target.widget.priority=Stored priority
ae2s_ponder.gui.priority_tuner.step.0=Set the priority value the tool should apply. Verify the sign and magnitude before using it on a machine.
ae2s_ponder.gui.priority_tuner.target.view.body=Application mode
ae2s_ponder.gui.priority_tuner.step.1=Read the native tool mode and item tooltip before applying changes to one or several devices.
ae2s_ponder.gui.priority_tuner.step.2=Inspect a modified device afterward to confirm its priority and intended storage behavior.
ae2s_ponder.gui.config_modifier.title=Configuration Modifier: amount operations
ae2s_ponder.gui.config_modifier.target.widget.data_input=Numeric operand
ae2s_ponder.gui.config_modifier.step.0=Enter the numeric operand used to adjust a compatible resource configuration. Inspect the original amounts before applying a bulk change.
ae2s_ponder.gui.config_modifier.target.widget.mode=Arithmetic mode
