ae2s_ponder.gui.config_modifier.step.2=Test one supported target and reopen its configuration. Confirm the resulting amounts before applying the tool to more devices.
ae2s_ponder.gui.quartz_knife.title=Quartz Cutting Knife: naming
ae2s_ponder.gui.quartz_knife.target.widget.name=Name
