ae2s_ponder.gui.renamer.target.view.body=Confirm in the parent screen
ae2s_ponder.gui.renamer.step.1=Return using the native control, then check the name where the item or device is listed.
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_renamer.title=Rename a pattern entry
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_renamer.target.widget.name=Descriptive name
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_renamer.step.0=Enter a name that distinguishes the device or pattern from similar entries.
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_renamer.target.view.body=Confirm in the parent screen
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_renamer.step.1=Return using the native control, then check the name where the item or device is listed.
ae2s_ponder.gui.output_sides.title=Machine output sides
ae2s_ponder.gui.output_sides.target.widget.side_front=Machine-relative sides
ae2s_ponder.gui.output_sides.step.0=The side controls are relative to the machine's orientation. Match the front with the actual placed block.
ae2s_ponder.gui.output_sides.target.widget.side_top=Enable the intended output
ae2s_ponder.gui.output_sides.step.1=Select only the sides connected to the intended receiving inventory. Test one product before using several outputs.
ae2s_ponder.gui.output_sides.target.widget.returnToParent=Return and test
ae2s_ponder.gui.output_sides.step.2=Return to the machine and confirm that extraction reaches the intended inventory or requesting ME network.
ae2s_ponder.gui.work_interval.title=Machine work interval
ae2s_ponder.gui.work_interval.target.widget.workInterval=Work interval
ae2s_ponder.gui.work_interval.step.0=Set the interval using the displayed unit. A shorter interval increases checking frequency rather than creating ingredients or destination space.
ae2s_ponder.gui.work_interval.target.view.body=Measure the result
ae2s_ponder.gui.work_interval.step.1=Test the actual throughput and server workload before applying a very short interval to many devices.
ae2s_ponder.gui.terminal_settings.title=Terminal preferences
ae2s_ponder.gui.terminal_settings.target.view.body=Settings categories
ae2s_ponder.gui.terminal_settings.step.0=Use the native settings pages to choose search, display, convenience and crafting preferences.
ae2s_ponder.gui.terminal_settings.step.1=Decide whether search is focused automatically and whether queries persist. Focused input keeps W available for typing.
ae2s_ponder.gui.terminal_settings.step.2=Review pickup, restock, crafting and grid-clear options before enabling them. These change real terminal behavior.
ae2s_ponder.gui.terminal_settings.target.widget.back=Return and verify
ae2s_ponder.gui.terminal_settings.step.3=Return and test the chosen settings with one item before relying on them during production.
ae2s_ponder.gui.key_types.title=Choose resource types
ae2s_ponder.gui.key_types.target.widget.keytypes=Resource type selection
ae2s_ponder.gui.key_types.step.0=Choose the supported resource types to display or handle, such as items or fluids. Available types depend on installed integrations.
ae2s_ponder.gui.key_types.target.widget.back=Check the resulting view
ae2s_ponder.gui.key_types.step.1=Return and verify that the filtered view still includes the resource you need. A hidden type is not deleted stock.
ae2s_ponder.gui.number_buttons.title=Number-entry shortcuts
ae2s_ponder.gui.number_buttons.target.view.body=Normal increments
ae2s_ponder.gui.number_buttons.step.0=Configure the normal increment buttons using the native numeric fields.
ae2s_ponder.gui.number_buttons.target.text.shift_label=Modified-key increments
ae2s_ponder.gui.number_buttons.step.1=Review Shift, Ctrl and Alt increments separately so a modified click does not unexpectedly request a large amount.
ae2s_ponder.gui.number_buttons.target.widget.back=Test the result
ae2s_ponder.gui.number_buttons.step.2=Return to the quantity dialog and test a small value before submitting the actual operation.
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_modifier.title=Pattern Modifier: batch editing
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_modifier.target.widget.mode=Editing mode
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_modifier.step.0=Choose the intended edit mode before selecting patterns. Batch edits can affect multiple installed recipes.
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_modifier.target.slot.ENCODED_PATTERN.0=Target patterns
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_modifier.step.1=Select the patterns to edit and verify their inputs and outputs. Keep a backup before replacing an established production recipe.
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_modifier.target.widget.replace=Replacement and cloning
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_modifier.step.2=Use replacement, cloning, quantity or property controls only after checking the selected operation and blank-pattern requirements.
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_modifier.target.widget.clear=Review changes
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_modifier.step.3=Inspect the edited patterns and test one recipe. Clear the selection when finished to avoid editing unrelated patterns next time.
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_import_priority.title=Recipe import priority
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_import_priority.target.view.body=Preferred recipe sources
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_import_priority.step.0=Arrange the preferred sources used when importing a recipe. This order concerns recipe selection, not storage priority.
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_import_priority.target.text.page_info=Review every page
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_import_priority.step.1=Inspect all available entries before accepting the order. Recipe-source options depend on installed recipe integrations.
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_import_priority.target.widget.back=Verify an import
ae2s_ponder.gui.pattern_import_priority.step.2=Return to encoding and import one recipe to verify the resulting ingredients and output.
ae2s_ponder.gui.processing_amount.title=Processing pattern amounts
ae2s_ponder.gui.processing_amount.target.widget.amountToStock=Exact resource amount
ae2s_ponder.gui.processing_amount.step.0=Set the amount for this processing entry and check the resource unit. Large fluid amounts are not equivalent to the same number of item stacks.
ae2s_ponder.gui.processing_amount.target.widget.back=Check the full recipe
ae2s_ponder.gui.processing_amount.step.1=Return and compare all input and output amounts before encoding. The requesting network waits for the exact declared product.
ae2s_ponder.gui.crafting_pattern_view.title=Inspect a crafting pattern
ae2s_ponder.gui.crafting_pattern_view.target.view.body=Recorded recipe
ae2s_ponder.gui.crafting_pattern_view.step.0=Inspect the crafting-grid layout and result recorded on the pattern. This view describes a recipe and does not craft items.
ae2s_ponder.gui.crafting_pattern_view.target.view.header=Substitution flags
ae2s_ponder.gui.crafting_pattern_view.step.1=Read the item and fluid substitution flags before assuming similar ingredients are interchangeable.
ae2s_ponder.gui.crafting_pattern_view.step.2=Install the intended pattern in the proper provider or assembler, then test one request.
ae2s_ponder.gui.processing_pattern_view.title=Inspect a processing pattern
ae2s_ponder.gui.processing_pattern_view.target.view.body=Inputs and outputs
ae2s_ponder.gui.processing_pattern_view.step.0=Inspect every declared input and output and its quantity. This display is read-only.
ae2s_ponder.gui.processing_pattern_view.step.1=A press or mold that stays installed in the machine must not be listed as consumed on every execution.
ae2s_ponder.gui.processing_pattern_view.step.2=Compare with the actual machine recipe and verify that the exact output returns to the same requesting network.
